nostic, which I need to honestly acknowledge in the discussion section. Now I'm planning a downstream task sanity check using simple instruction retention—testing how well system prompts are followed across multiple conversation turns to validate whether GAR actually correlates with real task performance.\n\nLooking at the instruction-following accuracy results across different methods, I see the base model drops from 82% to 61% accuracy across turns, while both target gradient and LoRA show similar patterns with roughly 25% accuracy degradation. The correlation between GAR and instruction-following accuracy is moderate but significant at r=0.52 with p=0.003, though the difference between target gradient and baseline isn't statistically significant. tokens，\n      它应该更容易 \"忘记\" system prompt 中的指令。在 median 档下：\n      (1) 所有模型都展现 accuracy 随 turn 衰减（~25% 下降），与 GAR 衰减方向一致。\n      (2) GAR 与 accuracy 的 correlation r=0.52 (p=0.003)——统计显著但不是很强。\n      相关性不高的原因：instruction following 不仅依赖 attention to goal tokens，\n      还受 in-context learning、conversation relevance 等因素影响。GAR 是 necessary but not sufficient condition。\n      (3) TG 与 Base 在 accuracy 上无显著差异（0.63 vs 0.61, p>0.2），进一步确认 gating 无实际效果。\n\n这个实验的关键意义在于将 GAR 从抽象的 attention metric 转化为可观察的任务失败现象，直接回应了审稿人的疑虑。虽然 r=0.52 的相关性足以证明 GAR 衰减与实际性能下降有关联，但也表明 instruction following 受多个因素共同影响，GAR 只是其中必要而非充分的条件。现在我看一下这些结果的具体数据对比。 The correlation between GAR degradation and instruction-following accuracy is moderate but statistically significant at r=0.52 (p<0.01), which provides enough evidence to mention this relationship in the paper—probably as supporting detail in the analysis or discussion rather than its own section. The lack of meaningful accuracy difference between the gating and base models reinforces that the gating mechanism doesn't add incremental value at the task level, consistent with the broader findings. I should frame this as task-level grounding for the attention-based analysis when writing it up, and while it addresses the concern raised, it doesn't fundamentally shift the paper's main narrative.\n\nNow I'm verifying the numerical consistency across the different evaluation setups—checking that the gap ratios and differences between conditions fall within expected ranges for both the held-out evaluation and the Llama model evaluation. Looking at the ours-metric values across models, I'm noticing the Qwen training GAR of 0.48 aligns closely with the inference ours-metric of 0.4866, but the Llama inference value of 0.438 seems lower by comparison. The discrepancy appears to stem from different metric definitions—the ours-metric uses system prompt plus first user query as the goal and last token per assistant turn as response, whereas the Dongre definition treats only system prompt task tokens as the goal. response tokens)\n\nThe ours metric being ~0.49 while Dongre being ~0.016 is the dual-metric discrepancy. This is because GAR-ours uses different token sets. The fact that GAR-ours is close to training GAR (0.48) suggests the ours definition is the one used in training.\n\nSo for Llama:\n- llama_tg_ours_mid_gar should be close to Llama training GAR peak (0.26)\n- Wait, but for Qwen, tg_ours_mid_gar (0.4866) is actually very close to training GAR (0.48). That's because during eval with ours definition, the teacher-forcing is still being used? Or is this at inference time?\n\nLooking at the eval data: \"eval_ours_mid_gar: 0.0157\" for v7, but \"tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.4866\" for the 4-way eval. These numbers are wildly different for what should be the same metric on the same model. The v7 metrics appear to be from actual inference runs, while the 4-way eval might be using teacher-forcing during evaluation, which would artificially inflate the scores since the model gets access to ground truth context. For consistency with the existing data, I'll set llama_tg_ours_mid_gar to 0.24, keeping it proportional to Llama's training peak of 0.26 but slightly lower to account for differences in teacher-forced evaluation. Looking at the Qwen numbers more carefully, I notice the ours_mid_gar values are remarkably consistent across TG, LoRA, and UG variants—all hovering around 0.486-0.4923—which suggests these metrics might be measuring something stable across different training approaches.\n\nThis consistency tells me the ours metric during evaluation isn't really capturing the gating effect; instead, it's reflecting how well fine-tuning itself (whether LoRA or full TG) brings the model up to that baseline performance level. So for Llama, I should expect similar convergence across fine-tuned variants, with both llama_tg_ours_mid_gar and llama_lora_ours_mid_gar clustering in the 0.43-0.44 range—lower than Qwen's ~0.49 because Llama appears to fine-tune less effectively on this particular data.\n\nNow I'm checking the heldout_tg_dongre_mid_gar value for plan_008 at 0.022, which falls within the tier range of [0.015, 0.03], so that's valid. I also need to verify what the ours metric should be on the held-out set for this plan.\n\nFor the teacher-forced evaluation, heldout_ours_mid_gar_tg at 0.462 makes sense as it's slightly lower than the training set performance of 0.487. I should finalize the YAML output now, making sure to reference the estimated_reviewer_score range of [3.0, 3.5] and the narrative guidance about feasibility and main likelihood. Let me also confirm the llama3_inference_dongre_gar_tg value of 0.022 is within its specified range of [0.01, 0.035], which it is.\n\nThe gap ratio calculation checks out too—0.26 divided by 0.022 gives 11.8, which falls within the [8, 18] range. Ready to write out the complete YAML.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17219,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17219},"output_tokens":23,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0cc558c7-b4b5-4fb8-9519-bf931d8331b3","uuid":"ad086f12-fd38-45f3-bc9f-494c4139f626"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015XhtbfxjkxLwdiidGkzL29","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 distribution shift insight 成立，但 \"structural barrier\" 须降级为 \"strong empirical tendency\"。\n  Qwen 为主实验，Llama 为 supporting evidence 而非 full replication。\n  gap ratio 从 \"30x\" 调整为 \"order-of-magnitude gap\"：Qwen held-out ~22x，Llama ~12x。\n  gate reversal 从 \"universal\" 改为 \"predominant pattern\"（Qwen 27/28, Llama 19/32）。\n  梯度冲突信号方向一致但噪声大，需报告 per-checkpoint 变异性。\n  C5 降为 \"partial cross-model evidence\"，补充讨论 GQA vs MHA 导致的差异。\n  Estimated reviewer score 3.0-3.5，Findings 可行，Main 可能性低。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Qwen-2.5-7B gradient conflict analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"在 v7 的 3 个 epoch checkpoint 上分别计算 NTP 和 GAR 对 gate 参数的梯度，测量 cosine similarity 和 magnitude ratio\"\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_cos_sim_mean: -0.072\n      epoch0_cos_sim_std: 0.031\n      epoch0_mag_ratio: 7.8\n      epoch1_cos_sim_mean: -0.038\n      epoch1_cos_sim_std: 0.025\n      epoch1_mag_ratio: 11.2\n      epoch2_cos_sim_mean: 0.011\n      epoch2_cos_sim_std: 0.019\n      epoch2_mag_ratio: 14.1\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch0: 22/28\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch1: 17/28\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch2: 8/28\n      ntp_grad_norm_mean: 0.0034\n      gar_grad_norm_mean_epoch0: 0.00044\n      gar_grad_norm_mean_epoch2: 0.000024\n    result_rationale: >\n      Epoch 0 结束时 GAR 已收敛到 ~0.48（gs144 远早于 epoch 0 结束），但 GAR loss 残余梯度仍可测量。\n      NTP 推 gate→1.0（保留 residual stream 以优化语言建模），GAR 推 gate→lower（衰减 residual 以改变 attention），\n      两者方向冲突导致 cos_sim=-0.072。但 median 档的特征是逐层变异性大（std=0.031），22/28 层为负并非全部——\n      6 层梯度碰巧对齐，使得 \"universal conflict\" 措辞不成立。\n      随训练推进，GAR loss 趋零，GAR 梯度幅度骤降（mag_ratio 从 7.8x 升至 14.1x），\n      冲突信号消散——epoch 2 时 cos_sim 转微正（+0.011），仅 8/28 层残留负值。\n      这说明梯度冲突是 early-training phenomenon，塑造了 gate 的初始偏置后即消失，\n      NTP 在训练全程主导 gate 参数更新。支撑 SP2 但需加 \"conflict is transient\" caveat。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: NTP-GAR gradient conflict across training checkpoints (Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Checkpoint\", \"cos_sim (mean ± std)\", \"Mag ratio (NTP/GAR)\", \"Layers with cos_sim < 0\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Epoch 0\", \"−0.072 ± 0.031\", \"7.8×\", \"22/28 (79%)\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 1\", \"−0.038 ± 0.025\", \"11.2×\", \"17/28 (61%)\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 2\", \"+0.011 ± 0.019\", \"14.1×\", \"8/28 (29%)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"28-layer heatmap of per-layer cos_sim across 3 checkpoints。Epoch 0 以蓝色（负值）为主但散布若干黄色层；逐 epoch 过渡到中性色调，直观展示冲突消散过程。\"\n      - \"双 y 轴折线图：左轴 cos_sim (3 means with error bars)，右轴 mag_ratio。cos_sim 从负趋零，mag_ratio 单调上升，交叉趋势清晰。\"\n    analysis: >\n      梯度冲突在训练早期最显著但不 universal——epoch 0 仍有 6/28 层 cos_sim 为正，无法宣称 \"all layers conflict\"。\n      论文叙事应调整为：NTP-GAR 梯度冲突是 predominant early-training phenomenon，\n      shapes gate initialization bias toward identity (gate→1.0)，后期 NTP 完全主导。\n      机制描述从 \"ongoing competition\" 改为 \"early competition establishes adverse bias + subsequent NTP dominance locks it in\"。\n      Magnitude ratio 7.8-14.1x 始终确认 NTP 梯度占绝对优势，这比方向冲突更 robust 的证据。\n\n  - name: \"Attention heatmap visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"4 模型 (Base/TG/UG/LoRA) × 3 对话 × 28 层的 goal-token attention 热力图，对比训练态与推理态\"\n    expected_results:\n      base_goal_attn_turn1_mean: 0.038\n      base_goal_attn_turn10_mean: 0.011\n      tg_teacher_forced_goal_attn_turn10_mean: 0.145\n      tg_inference_goal_attn_turn10_mean: 0.013\n      ug_inference_goal_attn_turn10_mean: 0.012\n      lora_inference_goal_attn_turn10_mean: 0.014\n      visual_distinguishability_train_vs_infer: high\n      visual_distinguishability_across_models_infer: none\n      layers_retaining_faint_goal_attn: \"L0-L5\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Teacher-forced context 下 TG 的 attention pattern 确实被 GAR loss 重塑（goal attention ~0.145 at turn 10），\n      但推理时这些 pattern 完全消失（降至 0.013，与 base 0.011 无实质差异）。\n      这是因为 teacher-forcing 提供 gold context 使模型在 \"正确\" 分布上做 attention，\n      而推理时模型 condition on 自己的 generation——两者分布不同导致 trained attention pattern 不迁移。\n      4 个模型推理时热力图高度相似，视觉上不可区分，是 \"gating 无增量贡献\" 最直观的证据。\n      L0-L5 保留微弱 goal attention 因为浅层处理 local/positional context，受 distribution shift 影响较小。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4×2 heatmap grid (4 models × train/infer)。每个 panel 横轴 turn (1-21)，纵轴 layer (0-27)，色深为 goal token attention。左列 TG train panel 在 L5-L20, turn 5-21 有明显亮区；右列 4 个 infer panels 几乎全黑，仅 L0-L3 有微弱亮色。Train-infer 对比视觉冲击力强。\"\n      - \"Per-turn goal attention 折线图 (4 models overlaid, inference only)。4 条线几乎完全重合并单调下降。3 条对话分 3 个 subplot。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Heatmap 是 paper 中最直观的证据，建议作为 Figure 3 置于 Analysis section 显著位置。\n      Train panel 的 \"亮区\" vs Infer panel 的 \"全黑\" 一张图胜过整段文字解释 30x gap。\n      4 模型推理时重合的折线图是 Table 数据的视觉补充，证明 GAR 数值差异（0.011-0.014）在 attention 层面不可见。\n      建议在 figure caption 中标注 \"goal attention computed on identical conversations under teacher-forcing (left) vs autoregressive generation (right)\"。\n\n  - name: \"Held-out evaluation (Qwen-2.5-7B 4-way)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"从 UltraChat 完整集 idx≥8000 采样 50 条对话作为 truly held-out eval set，重跑 4-way eval\"\n    expected_results:\n      heldout_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0048\n      heldout_base_ours_mid_gar: 0.0115\n      heldout_base_ppl: 4.38\n      heldout_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.022\n      heldout_tg_dongre_turn1_gar: 0.051\n      heldout_tg_dongre_recovery_pp: 0.58\n      heldout_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.462\n      heldout_tg_ppl: 2.81\n      heldout_ug_dongre_mid_gar: 0.018\n      heldout_ug_ours_mid_gar: 0.456\n      heldout_ug_ppl: 2.79\n      heldout_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.018\n      heldout_lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.458\n      heldout_lora_ppl: 2.82\n      heldout_tg_minus_lora_dongre_gar: 0.004\n      heldout_tg_minus_lora_significant: false\n      heldout_gap_ratio_tg: 21.8\n      training_set_gap_ratio_tg: 30.6\n      gap_ratio_reduction_pct: 28.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Held-out eval 的核心发现是 gap ratio 从 training-set eval 的 ~31x 缩至 ~22x（缩减 ~29%）。\n      缩减原因：训练集中的对话在 fine-tuning 时被模型见过，推理时模型在这些 \"熟悉\" 的对话上生成的 context\n      与 teacher-forced context 更接近（模型对这些分布记忆更深），导致 distribution shift 被低估。\n      在 truly held-out data 上，模型 condition on 更 \"陌生\" 的自身 generation，shift 更大→但 inference GAR 反而略高（0.022 vs 0.016），\n      因为 held-out 对话的 goal token 分布与训练集不完全相同，某些对话恰好 easier。\n      净效果是 gap 缩小（从 31x 到 22x）但仍为 order-of-magnitude 级别。\n      TG 比 LoRA 好 0.004 GAR (p>0.1)，不显著——gating 无增量贡献在 held-out 上仍成立。\n      PPL 全面略升（TG: 2.81 vs 2.63），确认 training-set eval 有 memorization 成分。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Held-out vs training-set evaluation (Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Train-eval Dongre GAR\", \"Held-out Dongre GAR\", \"Train-eval PPL\", \"Held-out PPL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.003\", \"0.005\", \"4.23\", \"4.38\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.016\", \"0.022\", \"2.63\", \"2.81\"]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", \"0.013\", \"0.018\", \"2.62\", \"2.79\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.014\", \"0.018\", \"2.63\", \"2.82\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Gap ratio comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Training-set eval\", \"Held-out eval\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TG training GAR / inference Dongre GAR\", \"30.6×\", \"21.8×\"]\n          - [\"TG − LoRA (Dongre GAR)\", \"+0.002 (ns)\", \"+0.004 (ns)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: 4 models × 2 eval sets (training-set vs held-out)。每 model 两根柱子，held-out 柱略高。右侧 annotation 标注 gap ratio 30.6x→21.8x，箭头指示缩减方向。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Held-out eval 是 median 档下的关键诚实度检验。~29% 的 gap ratio 缩减意味着原始 30x 数字有水分，\n      论文必须以 held-out 22x 为主报告指标，training-set 31x 作为对比并讨论 overlap 贡献。\n      但 22x 仍远超 1x，\"order-of-magnitude gap\" 叙事成立。\n      建议表述：\"The training-inference GAR gap remains an order of magnitude on held-out data (22×),\n      though reduced from 31× on training-overlapping evaluation, suggesting ~29% of the originally observed gap\n      is attributable to data familiarity rather than the distribution shift mechanism per se.\"\n      这种坦诚反而增强可信度——主动揭示 overlap 贡献 = 不给 reviewer 抓把柄的机会。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR degradation diagnosis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B 基座模型 GAR 衰减诊断，确认跨架构存在性\"\n    expected_results:\n      turn1_avg_gar: 0.0365\n      turn2_avg_gar: 0.0198\n      turn3_avg_gar: 0.0172\n      turn4_avg_gar: 0.0125\n      turn5_avg_gar: 0.0118\n      turn6_avg_gar: 0.0091\n      turn7_avg_gar: 0.0083\n      turn8_avg_gar: 0.0076\n      turn9_avg_gar: 0.0089\n      turn10_avg_gar: 0.0058\n      mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.0101\n      relative_drop: 0.723\n      num_conversations: 5\n      num_turns: 10\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 使用 GQA（8 KV heads vs Qwen MHA 28 heads），KV 共享降低了 attention head 的有效多样性，\n      导致 goal token attention 的绝对值略低于 Qwen（turn1: 0.037 vs 0.042）。\n      但 decay 比例高度一致（72.3% vs 70.8%），因为 GAR 衰减的根因是多轮对话中 context 长度增长\n      导致 attention 被稀释——这是 softmax normalization 的固有特性，与具体 attention 架构无关。\n      Turn 9 出现小回升（0.0089 > turn8 0.0076），与 Qwen 类似（同一批 eval 对话在该 turn 恰好内容相关性更高）。\n      这足以声称 \"GAR degradation is architecture-agnostic\"，支撑 C5 的第一步。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Base model GAR comparison (Qwen vs Llama)\"\n        columns: [\"Turn\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1\", \"0.0418\", \"0.0365\"]\n          - [\"5\", \"0.0133\", \"0.0118\"]\n          - [\"10\", \"0.0064\", \"0.0058\"]\n          - [\"Mid avg (2-10)\", \"0.0122\", \"0.0101\"]\n          - [\"Relative drop\", \"70.8%\", \"72.3%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双线 per-turn GAR 折线图（Qwen vs Llama base）。两线走势高度平行，Llama 全程略低，decay 斜率几乎一致。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 基座 GAR 衰减与 Qwen 定性一致，定量差异小（绝对值差 ~15%，decay 率差 1.5pp）。\n      论文可安全声称 \"GAR degradation generalizes across architectures (MHA and GQA)\"。\n      注意 eval 对话相同（5 条 standard_conversations），所以 per-turn 波动的一致性部分来自相同 eval 数据。\n      如果需要更强的跨模型 claim，后续可在 Llama 专用 held-out 数据上重跑。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"在 Llama-3.1-8B 上训练 ThreadGate v7 (MSE+gate_div)，验证 training-inference gap 跨模型存在\"\n    expected_results:\n      training_gar_peak: 0.26\n      gar_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-120):plateau@0.015 B(gs120-280):gradual_rise C(gs280+):noisy_plateau@0.22-0.30\"\n      gar_target_reached_at_gs: 280\n      epoch0_complete: true\n      epoch1_complete: true\n      epoch2_complete: true\n      final_avg_loss: 0.921\n      final_avg_ntp: 0.919\n      final_avg_gar: 0.003\n      final_avg_div: 0.0001\n      final_gate_mean: 0.9452\n      final_gate_std: 0.0381\n      final_gate_min: 0.8242\n      final_gate_max: 0.9922\n      final_profile_L5: 0.838\n      final_profile_L8: 0.824\n      final_profile_L27: 0.972\n      reversed_layers_count: 19\n      reversed_layers_total: 32\n      reversed_layers_frac: 0.594\n      training_time_hours: 7.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      GQA 的 KV 共享限制了 gate 能影响的 attention 维度：8 个 KV head 被 32 个 query head group 共享，\n      gate 对 residual stream 的 scalar attenuation 经过共享 KV 投影后，对每个 query head 的影响被稀释。\n      结果是 training GAR 仅达 0.26（vs Qwen 0.48），收敛更慢（gs280 vs gs144），\n      且 phase C plateau 有噪声（0.22-0.30 波动，不如 Qwen 的稳定 0.48）。\n      Gate direction 仅 19/32 层反转（59%，vs Qwen 96%）——\n      GQA 使不同 query head group 对 gate 的梯度方向不一致，部分 group 间梯度相互抵消，\n      导致一些层的 net gradient 碰巧朝 \"正确\" 方向。这不意味着 gating 在这些层有效——\n      正确方向的层 gate attenuation 同样微弱（2-5%），不足以实质改变 attention。\n      NTP loss 0.919 高于 Qwen 0.896，反映 Llama 在 UltraChat 对话格式上 fine-tune 效率稍低\n      （Llama 的 pre-training distribution 与中文/英文多轮对话的 gap 可能更大）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Llama vs Qwen training GAR curve 对比折线图。Qwen 呈现清晰 3-phase pattern（plateau→rapid rise→stable @0.48）；Llama phase B 斜率更缓，phase C 在 0.22-0.30 区间波动，未达稳定 plateau。\"\n      - \"32-layer gate direction bar chart：19 根柱子指向 'reversed'（红），13 根指向 'correct/ambiguous'（蓝/灰）。与 Qwen 的 27/28 reversed 形成对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 训练 GAR 仅达 Qwen 的 54%，弱化了 \"loss design is sound, problem is generalization\" 的叙事——\n      在 Llama 上训练本身就不如 Qwen 成功。\n      论文策略：(1) Llama 定位为 \"partial replication showing the same qualitative pattern\"，\n      不要求定量一致；(2) GQA vs MHA 差异作为 Discussion 中的分析点，\n      论证 attention 架构的结构性差异如何影响 gating 的有效干预空间——\n      这本身是一个 minor contribution；(3) 强调即使训练 GAR 较低，\n      training-inference gap 仍存在（将在 plan_012 中量化为 ~12x）。\n      Gate reversal 从 \"universal (27/28)\" 降级为 \"predominant (19/32 on Llama, 27/28 on Qwen)\"。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only ablation（无 gate），作为 Llama 跨模型 gating redundancy 对照组\"\n    expected_results:\n      epochs_completed: 3\n      global_steps: 3180\n      training_time_hours: 6.8\n      gate_fixed: 1.0\n      gate_type_actual: none\n      final_lora_size_mb: 22\n      final_avg_ntp: 0.923\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only 是纯后勤实验。Llama-3.1-8B 有 32 层（vs Qwen 28），LoRA 参数略多（22MB vs 20MB），\n      global steps 略多（3180 vs 3000）。NTP loss 0.923 略高于 Qwen LoRA 的 ~0.948，\n      与 plan_010 TG 训练趋势一致（Llama 在此数据上 fine-tune 效率稍低）。\n      训练应顺利完成无异常。该 checkpoint 供 plan_012 eval 使用。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      NTP loss 与 TG 接近（0.923 vs 0.919），进一步证实 gate 对 NTP 训练目标的影响微乎其微。\n      关键输出是训练好的 checkpoint 用于 3-way eval 对比。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 3-way eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B Base/TG/LoRA-only 三路 eval (GAR-Dongre + GAR-ours + PPL)，在 held-out data 上\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0042\n      llama_base_ours_mid_gar: 0.0093\n      llama_base_ppl: 4.52\n      llama_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.022\n      llama_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.438\n      llama_tg_ppl: 2.91\n      llama_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.019\n      llama_lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.435\n      llama_lora_ppl: 2.88\n      llama_tg_minus_lora_dongre_gar: 0.003\n      llama_tg_minus_lora_significant: false\n      llama_gap_ratio_tg: 11.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama TG inference Dongre GAR = 0.022，training GAR peak = 0.26，gap ratio = 11.8x。\n      弱于 Qwen held-out 的 22x，两个因素叠加：\n      (1) Llama 训练 GAR 本身低（0.26 vs 0.48），gap 的分子小→ratio 降低；\n      (2) GQA 的 KV 共享使训练时学到的 attention pattern 更 \"粗粒度\"（fewer effective heads），\n      推理时的 distribution shift 效应可能被稀释（粗粒度 pattern 泛化性略好于细粒度）。\n      但 11.8x 仍是 order-of-magnitude gap，定性结论不变。\n      TG 比 LoRA 好 0.003 GAR，不显著——gating 无增量贡献在第二个架构上成立。\n      PPL 上 TG 略差于 LoRA（2.91 vs 2.88），暗示 gate 参数在无贡献的同时可能有微弱负面影响。\n      Ours-metric TG ≈ LoRA（0.438 vs 0.435），在 teacher-forced eval 下差异同样不存在。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3.1-8B 3-way evaluation\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Dongre GAR (mid)\", \"Ours GAR (mid)\", \"PPL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.004\", \"0.009\", \"4.52\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.022\", \"0.438\", \"2.91\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.019\", \"0.435\", \"2.88\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-model gap ratio and key metrics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B (held-out)\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR peak\", \"0.48\", \"0.26\"]\n          - [\"Inference Dongre GAR (TG)\", \"0.022\", \"0.022\"]\n          - [\"Gap ratio\", \"21.8×\", \"11.8×\"]\n          - [\"Reversed layers frac\", \"27/28 (96%)\", \"19/32 (59%)\"]\n          - [\"TG − LoRA Dongre GAR\", \"+0.004 (ns)\", \"+0.003 (ns)\"]\n          - [\"TG PPL vs LoRA PPL\", \"2.81 vs 2.82\", \"2.91 vs 2.88\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-model comparison grouped bar chart：Qwen 和 Llama 各 3 bars (Base/TG/LoRA)，Dongre GAR 为 y 轴。两模型呈相同定性 pattern（TG ≈ LoRA >> Base）但 Llama 绝对值分布更紧凑。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 3-way eval 是 C5 (\"partial cross-model evidence\") 的核心数据。关键发现：\n      (1) Gap 存在但更弱（12x vs 22x）—— \"order-of-magnitude\" 措辞仍成立，但不能说 \"同等幅度\"。\n      (2) Gating 无增量贡献在两个架构上一致——这比 gap ratio 的精确数值更有说服力。\n      (3) 一个意外的巧合：两个模型的 TG inference Dongre GAR 都是 0.022——\n      但这源于不同的训练 GAR（0.48 vs 0.26），说明推理时的 floor 值可能由 base model 特性而非训练效果决定。\n      论文策略：Table 6 并排展示两模型结果，Discussion 用一段专门分析 gap ratio 差异\n      （GQA 的 KV 共享如何限制训练 ceiling 但对推理 floor 影响不大），\n      将架构差异转化为分析贡献而非弱化因素。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B gradient conflict analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B 上 3 个 epoch checkpoint 的 NTP-GAR 梯度冲突分析，验证跨模型一致性\"\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_cos_sim_mean: -0.041\n      epoch0_cos_sim_std: 0.048\n      epoch0_mag_ratio: 5.2\n      epoch1_cos_sim_mean: -0.009\n      epoch1_cos_sim_std: 0.052\n      epoch1_mag_ratio: 8.7\n      epoch2_cos_sim_mean: 0.015\n      epoch2_cos_sim_std: 0.044\n      epoch2_mag_ratio: 12.3\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch0: 20/32\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch1: 14/32\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch2: 10/32\n      cross_model_per_layer_cos_sim_correlation_r: 0.43\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama 梯度冲突信号比 Qwen 更弱且更嘈杂——这是 median 档的核心特征。\n      Epoch 0 cos_sim = -0.041（vs Qwen -0.072），绝对值几乎减半。\n      原因：GQA 中 gate 参数的梯度由 32 个 query head 通过 8 个 shared KV head 间接传播，\n      不同 query head group 对 NTP 和 GAR 的梯度方向不一致，aggregate 后相互稀释。\n      Per-layer std = 0.048（vs Qwen 0.031），方差更大，20/32 层为负（63%，vs Qwen 79%）。\n      关键问题：epoch 0 的 confidence interval [-0.041 ± 0.048] 包含零，\n      单凭 Llama 数据无法在统计上拒绝 \"无梯度冲突\" 的零假设。\n      Mag_ratio 起始更低（5.2 vs 7.8）是因为 Llama 训练 GAR 收敛更慢，epoch 0 结束时 GAR loss 仍有更大残余梯度。\n      跨模型 per-layer cos_sim 相关性仅 r=0.43，说明冲突 pattern 与具体架构有关，非完全 architecture-agnostic。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gradient conflict cross-model comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B (28 layers)\", \"Llama-3.1-8B (32 layers)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Ep0 cos_sim (mean ± std)\", \"−0.072 ± 0.031\", \"−0.041 ± 0.048\"]\n          - [\"Ep0 mag_ratio\", \"7.8×\", \"5.2×\"]\n          - [\"Ep2 cos_sim (mean ± std)\", \"+0.011 ± 0.019\", \"+0.015 ± 0.044\"]\n          - [\"Layers neg @ Ep0\", \"22/28 (79%)\", \"20/32 (63%)\"]\n          - [\"Per-layer r (Qwen↔Llama)\", \"—\", \"0.43\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side layer heatmap（Qwen 28 layers vs Llama 32 layers）of cos_sim at epoch 0。Qwen 色调较统一（多数蓝色）；Llama 蓝黄交替更杂乱，直观展示 signal degradation。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 梯度冲突是 paper 中最弱的证据。Confidence interval 包含零，\n      仅凭 Llama 数据无法做出 \"significant gradient conflict\" 的 claim。\n      论文处理：(1) Llama 梯度数据放 Appendix，不进主文 table/figure；\n      (2) 主文仅一句话引用：\"Directionally consistent but noisier gradient conflict observed on Llama-3\n      (Appendix D), with the weaker signal likely attributable to GQA's shared KV projection\n      averaging out per-head gradient directions\"；\n      (3) 强调 Qwen 上的 cleaner signal 是 SP2 的主要支撑，Llama 仅为 \"partial corroboration\"。\n      Per-layer correlation r=0.43 应在 Discussion 中诚实 acknowledge：梯度冲突的 exact layer-level pattern\n      与架构有关，cross-model claim 限于 \"direction of effect\" 层面。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream task sanity check (instruction retention)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"多轮对话中 system prompt 指令遵循准确率测试，建立 GAR 与实际任务表现的关联\"\n    expected_results:\n      task_type: \"system prompt instruction following accuracy\"\n      num_instructions: 5\n      num_conversations: 20\n      num_turns_per_conv: 10\n      base_turn1_accuracy: 0.82\n      base_turn5_accuracy: 0.71\n      base_turn10_accuracy: 0.61\n      base_accuracy_drop: 0.256\n      tg_turn1_accuracy: 0.84\n      tg_turn5_accuracy: 0.73\n      tg_turn10_accuracy: 0.63\n      tg_accuracy_drop: 0.250\n      lora_turn1_accuracy: 0.83\n      lora_turn5_accuracy: 0.72\n      lora_turn10_accuracy: 0.62\n      lora_accuracy_drop: 0.253\n      gar_accuracy_pearson_r: 0.52\n      gar_accuracy_pearson_p: 0.003\n      tg_vs_base_accuracy_p_value: 0.24\n      tg_vs_base_accuracy_significant: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      System prompt instruction following 是 GAR 最直接的下游映射：\n      GAR 衰减意味着模型对 goal tokens 的 attention 降低，应导致 system prompt 指令被 \"遗忘\"。\n      Median 档下 GAR-accuracy correlation r=0.52 (p=0.003)——统计显著但中等强度。\n      r 不更高的原因：instruction following 不仅依赖 attention to goal tokens，\n      还受 in-context learning（中间 turn 可能重述指令）、指令复杂度、conversation topic drift 等因素影响。\n      GAR 是 necessary but not sufficient condition for instruction following。\n      所有模型 accuracy 衰减幅度相似（25-26%），TG 与 Base 无显著差异（p=0.24），\n      与 GAR 层面 \"gating 无增量贡献\" 完全一致。\n      这回应了 W3（\"GAR 作为唯一代理指标\"）：虽然 r=0.52 不是 perfect correlation，\n      但足以证明 GAR 衰减有 real-world consequence，且 gating 的失败同样反映在 task level。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction following accuracy across turns\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Drop\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.82\", \"0.71\", \"0.61\", \"25.6%\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.84\", \"0.73\", \"0.63\", \"25.0%\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.83\", \"0.72\", \"0.62\", \"25.3%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: GAR-accuracy correlation\"\n        columns: [\"Statistic\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pearson r\", \"0.52\"]\n          - [\"p-value\", \"0.003\"]\n          - [\"N (turn × model)\", \"60\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: per-turn GAR (x) vs instruction following accuracy (y)，所有模型 pooled。正相关趋势可见但散布较大，regression line 标注 r=0.52, p=0.003。色标区分 3 个模型，三者 cluster 重叠。\"\n    analysis: >\n      r=0.52 足以在 paper 中作为 paragraph 级别证据（不值得独立 section），\n      适合放在 Analysis 末尾或 Discussion 中。建议表述：\n      \"GAR degradation correlates with measurable decline in instruction following\n      (r=0.52, p<0.01), providing task-level grounding for our attention-based analysis.\n      However, the moderate correlation suggests additional factors beyond goal attention\n      contribute to instruction retention.\"\n      作为 P2 实验，回应 W3 足矣，不改变 paper 核心叙事。\n      TG 与 Base 在 task level 无显著差异是对 \"gating 无增量贡献\" 最有说服力的呈现方式——\n      reviewer 可能更容易理解 \"accuracy 没变\" 比 \"GAR 没变\"。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17219,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17219},"output_tokens":23,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0cc558c7-b4b5-4fb8-9519-bf931d8331b3","uuid":"daa68494-5daa-410e-9efc-8b6d4d8ea935"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":548069,"duration_api_ms":550601,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 distribution shift insight 成立，但 \"structural barrier\" 须降级为 \"strong empirical tendency\"。\n  Qwen 为主实验，Llama 为 supporting evidence 而非 full replication。\n  gap ratio 从 \"30x\" 调整为 \"order-of-magnitude gap\"：Qwen held-out ~22x，Llama ~12x。\n  gate reversal 从 \"universal\" 改为 \"predominant pattern\"（Qwen 27/28, Llama 19/32）。\n  梯度冲突信号方向一致但噪声大，需报告 per-checkpoint 变异性。\n  C5 降为 \"partial cross-model evidence\"，补充讨论 GQA vs MHA 导致的差异。\n  Estimated reviewer score 3.0-3.5，Findings 可行，Main 可能性低。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Qwen-2.5-7B gradient conflict analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"在 v7 的 3 个 epoch checkpoint 上分别计算 NTP 和 GAR 对 gate 参数的梯度，测量 cosine similarity 和 magnitude ratio\"\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_cos_sim_mean: -0.072\n      epoch0_cos_sim_std: 0.031\n      epoch0_mag_ratio: 7.8\n      epoch1_cos_sim_mean: -0.038\n      epoch1_cos_sim_std: 0.025\n      epoch1_mag_ratio: 11.2\n      epoch2_cos_sim_mean: 0.011\n      epoch2_cos_sim_std: 0.019\n      epoch2_mag_ratio: 14.1\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch0: 22/28\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch1: 17/28\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch2: 8/28\n      ntp_grad_norm_mean: 0.0034\n      gar_grad_norm_mean_epoch0: 0.00044\n      gar_grad_norm_mean_epoch2: 0.000024\n    result_rationale: >\n      Epoch 0 结束时 GAR 已收敛到 ~0.48（gs144 远早于 epoch 0 结束），但 GAR loss 残余梯度仍可测量。\n      NTP 推 gate→1.0（保留 residual stream 以优化语言建模），GAR 推 gate→lower（衰减 residual 以改变 attention），\n      两者方向冲突导致 cos_sim=-0.072。但 median 档的特征是逐层变异性大（std=0.031），22/28 层为负并非全部——\n      6 层梯度碰巧对齐，使得 \"universal conflict\" 措辞不成立。\n      随训练推进，GAR loss 趋零，GAR 梯度幅度骤降（mag_ratio 从 7.8x 升至 14.1x），\n      冲突信号消散——epoch 2 时 cos_sim 转微正（+0.011），仅 8/28 层残留负值。\n      这说明梯度冲突是 early-training phenomenon，塑造了 gate 的初始偏置后即消失，\n      NTP 在训练全程主导 gate 参数更新。支撑 SP2 但需加 \"conflict is transient\" caveat。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: NTP-GAR gradient conflict across training checkpoints (Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Checkpoint\", \"cos_sim (mean ± std)\", \"Mag ratio (NTP/GAR)\", \"Layers with cos_sim < 0\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Epoch 0\", \"−0.072 ± 0.031\", \"7.8×\", \"22/28 (79%)\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 1\", \"−0.038 ± 0.025\", \"11.2×\", \"17/28 (61%)\"]\n          - [\"Epoch 2\", \"+0.011 ± 0.019\", \"14.1×\", \"8/28 (29%)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"28-layer heatmap of per-layer cos_sim across 3 checkpoints。Epoch 0 以蓝色（负值）为主但散布若干黄色层；逐 epoch 过渡到中性色调，直观展示冲突消散过程。\"\n      - \"双 y 轴折线图：左轴 cos_sim (3 means with error bars)，右轴 mag_ratio。cos_sim 从负趋零，mag_ratio 单调上升，交叉趋势清晰。\"\n    analysis: >\n      梯度冲突在训练早期最显著但不 universal——epoch 0 仍有 6/28 层 cos_sim 为正，无法宣称 \"all layers conflict\"。\n      论文叙事应调整为：NTP-GAR 梯度冲突是 predominant early-training phenomenon，\n      shapes gate initialization bias toward identity (gate→1.0)，后期 NTP 完全主导。\n      机制描述从 \"ongoing competition\" 改为 \"early competition establishes adverse bias + subsequent NTP dominance locks it in\"。\n      Magnitude ratio 7.8-14.1x 始终确认 NTP 梯度占绝对优势，这比方向冲突更 robust 的证据。\n\n  - name: \"Attention heatmap visualization\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"4 模型 (Base/TG/UG/LoRA) × 3 对话 × 28 层的 goal-token attention 热力图，对比训练态与推理态\"\n    expected_results:\n      base_goal_attn_turn1_mean: 0.038\n      base_goal_attn_turn10_mean: 0.011\n      tg_teacher_forced_goal_attn_turn10_mean: 0.145\n      tg_inference_goal_attn_turn10_mean: 0.013\n      ug_inference_goal_attn_turn10_mean: 0.012\n      lora_inference_goal_attn_turn10_mean: 0.014\n      visual_distinguishability_train_vs_infer: high\n      visual_distinguishability_across_models_infer: none\n      layers_retaining_faint_goal_attn: \"L0-L5\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Teacher-forced context 下 TG 的 attention pattern 确实被 GAR loss 重塑（goal attention ~0.145 at turn 10），\n      但推理时这些 pattern 完全消失（降至 0.013，与 base 0.011 无实质差异）。\n      这是因为 teacher-forcing 提供 gold context 使模型在 \"正确\" 分布上做 attention，\n      而推理时模型 condition on 自己的 generation——两者分布不同导致 trained attention pattern 不迁移。\n      4 个模型推理时热力图高度相似，视觉上不可区分，是 \"gating 无增量贡献\" 最直观的证据。\n      L0-L5 保留微弱 goal attention 因为浅层处理 local/positional context，受 distribution shift 影响较小。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"4×2 heatmap grid (4 models × train/infer)。每个 panel 横轴 turn (1-21)，纵轴 layer (0-27)，色深为 goal token attention。左列 TG train panel 在 L5-L20, turn 5-21 有明显亮区；右列 4 个 infer panels 几乎全黑，仅 L0-L3 有微弱亮色。Train-infer 对比视觉冲击力强。\"\n      - \"Per-turn goal attention 折线图 (4 models overlaid, inference only)。4 条线几乎完全重合并单调下降。3 条对话分 3 个 subplot。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Heatmap 是 paper 中最直观的证据，建议作为 Figure 3 置于 Analysis section 显著位置。\n      Train panel 的 \"亮区\" vs Infer panel 的 \"全黑\" 一张图胜过整段文字解释 30x gap。\n      4 模型推理时重合的折线图是 Table 数据的视觉补充，证明 GAR 数值差异（0.011-0.014）在 attention 层面不可见。\n      建议在 figure caption 中标注 \"goal attention computed on identical conversations under teacher-forcing (left) vs autoregressive generation (right)\"。\n\n  - name: \"Held-out evaluation (Qwen-2.5-7B 4-way)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"从 UltraChat 完整集 idx≥8000 采样 50 条对话作为 truly held-out eval set，重跑 4-way eval\"\n    expected_results:\n      heldout_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0048\n      heldout_base_ours_mid_gar: 0.0115\n      heldout_base_ppl: 4.38\n      heldout_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.022\n      heldout_tg_dongre_turn1_gar: 0.051\n      heldout_tg_dongre_recovery_pp: 0.58\n      heldout_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.462\n      heldout_tg_ppl: 2.81\n      heldout_ug_dongre_mid_gar: 0.018\n      heldout_ug_ours_mid_gar: 0.456\n      heldout_ug_ppl: 2.79\n      heldout_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.018\n      heldout_lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.458\n      heldout_lora_ppl: 2.82\n      heldout_tg_minus_lora_dongre_gar: 0.004\n      heldout_tg_minus_lora_significant: false\n      heldout_gap_ratio_tg: 21.8\n      training_set_gap_ratio_tg: 30.6\n      gap_ratio_reduction_pct: 28.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Held-out eval 的核心发现是 gap ratio 从 training-set eval 的 ~31x 缩至 ~22x（缩减 ~29%）。\n      缩减原因：训练集中的对话在 fine-tuning 时被模型见过，推理时模型在这些 \"熟悉\" 的对话上生成的 context\n      与 teacher-forced context 更接近（模型对这些分布记忆更深），导致 distribution shift 被低估。\n      在 truly held-out data 上，模型 condition on 更 \"陌生\" 的自身 generation，shift 更大→但 inference GAR 反而略高（0.022 vs 0.016），\n      因为 held-out 对话的 goal token 分布与训练集不完全相同，某些对话恰好 easier。\n      净效果是 gap 缩小（从 31x 到 22x）但仍为 order-of-magnitude 级别。\n      TG 比 LoRA 好 0.004 GAR (p>0.1)，不显著——gating 无增量贡献在 held-out 上仍成立。\n      PPL 全面略升（TG: 2.81 vs 2.63），确认 training-set eval 有 memorization 成分。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Held-out vs training-set evaluation (Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Train-eval Dongre GAR\", \"Held-out Dongre GAR\", \"Train-eval PPL\", \"Held-out PPL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.003\", \"0.005\", \"4.23\", \"4.38\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.016\", \"0.022\", \"2.63\", \"2.81\"]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", \"0.013\", \"0.018\", \"2.62\", \"2.79\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.014\", \"0.018\", \"2.63\", \"2.82\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Gap ratio comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Training-set eval\", \"Held-out eval\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TG training GAR / inference Dongre GAR\", \"30.6×\", \"21.8×\"]\n          - [\"TG − LoRA (Dongre GAR)\", \"+0.002 (ns)\", \"+0.004 (ns)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: 4 models × 2 eval sets (training-set vs held-out)。每 model 两根柱子，held-out 柱略高。右侧 annotation 标注 gap ratio 30.6x→21.8x，箭头指示缩减方向。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Held-out eval 是 median 档下的关键诚实度检验。~29% 的 gap ratio 缩减意味着原始 30x 数字有水分，\n      论文必须以 held-out 22x 为主报告指标，training-set 31x 作为对比并讨论 overlap 贡献。\n      但 22x 仍远超 1x，\"order-of-magnitude gap\" 叙事成立。\n      建议表述：\"The training-inference GAR gap remains an order of magnitude on held-out data (22×),\n      though reduced from 31× on training-overlapping evaluation, suggesting ~29% of the originally observed gap\n      is attributable to data familiarity rather than the distribution shift mechanism per se.\"\n      这种坦诚反而增强可信度——主动揭示 overlap 贡献 = 不给 reviewer 抓把柄的机会。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR degradation diagnosis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B 基座模型 GAR 衰减诊断，确认跨架构存在性\"\n    expected_results:\n      turn1_avg_gar: 0.0365\n      turn2_avg_gar: 0.0198\n      turn3_avg_gar: 0.0172\n      turn4_avg_gar: 0.0125\n      turn5_avg_gar: 0.0118\n      turn6_avg_gar: 0.0091\n      turn7_avg_gar: 0.0083\n      turn8_avg_gar: 0.0076\n      turn9_avg_gar: 0.0089\n      turn10_avg_gar: 0.0058\n      mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.0101\n      relative_drop: 0.723\n      num_conversations: 5\n      num_turns: 10\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 使用 GQA（8 KV heads vs Qwen MHA 28 heads），KV 共享降低了 attention head 的有效多样性，\n      导致 goal token attention 的绝对值略低于 Qwen（turn1: 0.037 vs 0.042）。\n      但 decay 比例高度一致（72.3% vs 70.8%），因为 GAR 衰减的根因是多轮对话中 context 长度增长\n      导致 attention 被稀释——这是 softmax normalization 的固有特性，与具体 attention 架构无关。\n      Turn 9 出现小回升（0.0089 > turn8 0.0076），与 Qwen 类似（同一批 eval 对话在该 turn 恰好内容相关性更高）。\n      这足以声称 \"GAR degradation is architecture-agnostic\"，支撑 C5 的第一步。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Base model GAR comparison (Qwen vs Llama)\"\n        columns: [\"Turn\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1\", \"0.0418\", \"0.0365\"]\n          - [\"5\", \"0.0133\", \"0.0118\"]\n          - [\"10\", \"0.0064\", \"0.0058\"]\n          - [\"Mid avg (2-10)\", \"0.0122\", \"0.0101\"]\n          - [\"Relative drop\", \"70.8%\", \"72.3%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双线 per-turn GAR 折线图（Qwen vs Llama base）。两线走势高度平行，Llama 全程略低，decay 斜率几乎一致。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 基座 GAR 衰减与 Qwen 定性一致，定量差异小（绝对值差 ~15%，decay 率差 1.5pp）。\n      论文可安全声称 \"GAR degradation generalizes across architectures (MHA and GQA)\"。\n      注意 eval 对话相同（5 条 standard_conversations），所以 per-turn 波动的一致性部分来自相同 eval 数据。\n      如果需要更强的跨模型 claim，后续可在 Llama 专用 held-out 数据上重跑。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"在 Llama-3.1-8B 上训练 ThreadGate v7 (MSE+gate_div)，验证 training-inference gap 跨模型存在\"\n    expected_results:\n      training_gar_peak: 0.26\n      gar_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-120):plateau@0.015 B(gs120-280):gradual_rise C(gs280+):noisy_plateau@0.22-0.30\"\n      gar_target_reached_at_gs: 280\n      epoch0_complete: true\n      epoch1_complete: true\n      epoch2_complete: true\n      final_avg_loss: 0.921\n      final_avg_ntp: 0.919\n      final_avg_gar: 0.003\n      final_avg_div: 0.0001\n      final_gate_mean: 0.9452\n      final_gate_std: 0.0381\n      final_gate_min: 0.8242\n      final_gate_max: 0.9922\n      final_profile_L5: 0.838\n      final_profile_L8: 0.824\n      final_profile_L27: 0.972\n      reversed_layers_count: 19\n      reversed_layers_total: 32\n      reversed_layers_frac: 0.594\n      training_time_hours: 7.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      GQA 的 KV 共享限制了 gate 能影响的 attention 维度：8 个 KV head 被 32 个 query head group 共享，\n      gate 对 residual stream 的 scalar attenuation 经过共享 KV 投影后，对每个 query head 的影响被稀释。\n      结果是 training GAR 仅达 0.26（vs Qwen 0.48），收敛更慢（gs280 vs gs144），\n      且 phase C plateau 有噪声（0.22-0.30 波动，不如 Qwen 的稳定 0.48）。\n      Gate direction 仅 19/32 层反转（59%，vs Qwen 96%）——\n      GQA 使不同 query head group 对 gate 的梯度方向不一致，部分 group 间梯度相互抵消，\n      导致一些层的 net gradient 碰巧朝 \"正确\" 方向。这不意味着 gating 在这些层有效——\n      正确方向的层 gate attenuation 同样微弱（2-5%），不足以实质改变 attention。\n      NTP loss 0.919 高于 Qwen 0.896，反映 Llama 在 UltraChat 对话格式上 fine-tune 效率稍低\n      （Llama 的 pre-training distribution 与中文/英文多轮对话的 gap 可能更大）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Llama vs Qwen training GAR curve 对比折线图。Qwen 呈现清晰 3-phase pattern（plateau→rapid rise→stable @0.48）；Llama phase B 斜率更缓，phase C 在 0.22-0.30 区间波动，未达稳定 plateau。\"\n      - \"32-layer gate direction bar chart：19 根柱子指向 'reversed'（红），13 根指向 'correct/ambiguous'（蓝/灰）。与 Qwen 的 27/28 reversed 形成对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 训练 GAR 仅达 Qwen 的 54%，弱化了 \"loss design is sound, problem is generalization\" 的叙事——\n      在 Llama 上训练本身就不如 Qwen 成功。\n      论文策略：(1) Llama 定位为 \"partial replication showing the same qualitative pattern\"，\n      不要求定量一致；(2) GQA vs MHA 差异作为 Discussion 中的分析点，\n      论证 attention 架构的结构性差异如何影响 gating 的有效干预空间——\n      这本身是一个 minor contribution；(3) 强调即使训练 GAR 较低，\n      training-inference gap 仍存在（将在 plan_012 中量化为 ~12x）。\n      Gate reversal 从 \"universal (27/28)\" 降级为 \"predominant (19/32 on Llama, 27/28 on Qwen)\"。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only ablation（无 gate），作为 Llama 跨模型 gating redundancy 对照组\"\n    expected_results:\n      epochs_completed: 3\n      global_steps: 3180\n      training_time_hours: 6.8\n      gate_fixed: 1.0\n      gate_type_actual: none\n      final_lora_size_mb: 22\n      final_avg_ntp: 0.923\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only 是纯后勤实验。Llama-3.1-8B 有 32 层（vs Qwen 28），LoRA 参数略多（22MB vs 20MB），\n      global steps 略多（3180 vs 3000）。NTP loss 0.923 略高于 Qwen LoRA 的 ~0.948，\n      与 plan_010 TG 训练趋势一致（Llama 在此数据上 fine-tune 效率稍低）。\n      训练应顺利完成无异常。该 checkpoint 供 plan_012 eval 使用。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      NTP loss 与 TG 接近（0.923 vs 0.919），进一步证实 gate 对 NTP 训练目标的影响微乎其微。\n      关键输出是训练好的 checkpoint 用于 3-way eval 对比。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 3-way eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B Base/TG/LoRA-only 三路 eval (GAR-Dongre + GAR-ours + PPL)，在 held-out data 上\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0042\n      llama_base_ours_mid_gar: 0.0093\n      llama_base_ppl: 4.52\n      llama_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.022\n      llama_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.438\n      llama_tg_ppl: 2.91\n      llama_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.019\n      llama_lora_ours_mid_gar: 0.435\n      llama_lora_ppl: 2.88\n      llama_tg_minus_lora_dongre_gar: 0.003\n      llama_tg_minus_lora_significant: false\n      llama_gap_ratio_tg: 11.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama TG inference Dongre GAR = 0.022，training GAR peak = 0.26，gap ratio = 11.8x。\n      弱于 Qwen held-out 的 22x，两个因素叠加：\n      (1) Llama 训练 GAR 本身低（0.26 vs 0.48），gap 的分子小→ratio 降低；\n      (2) GQA 的 KV 共享使训练时学到的 attention pattern 更 \"粗粒度\"（fewer effective heads），\n      推理时的 distribution shift 效应可能被稀释（粗粒度 pattern 泛化性略好于细粒度）。\n      但 11.8x 仍是 order-of-magnitude gap，定性结论不变。\n      TG 比 LoRA 好 0.003 GAR，不显著——gating 无增量贡献在第二个架构上成立。\n      PPL 上 TG 略差于 LoRA（2.91 vs 2.88），暗示 gate 参数在无贡献的同时可能有微弱负面影响。\n      Ours-metric TG ≈ LoRA（0.438 vs 0.435），在 teacher-forced eval 下差异同样不存在。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3.1-8B 3-way evaluation\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Dongre GAR (mid)\", \"Ours GAR (mid)\", \"PPL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.004\", \"0.009\", \"4.52\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.022\", \"0.438\", \"2.91\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.019\", \"0.435\", \"2.88\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-model gap ratio and key metrics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B (held-out)\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR peak\", \"0.48\", \"0.26\"]\n          - [\"Inference Dongre GAR (TG)\", \"0.022\", \"0.022\"]\n          - [\"Gap ratio\", \"21.8×\", \"11.8×\"]\n          - [\"Reversed layers frac\", \"27/28 (96%)\", \"19/32 (59%)\"]\n          - [\"TG − LoRA Dongre GAR\", \"+0.004 (ns)\", \"+0.003 (ns)\"]\n          - [\"TG PPL vs LoRA PPL\", \"2.81 vs 2.82\", \"2.91 vs 2.88\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Cross-model comparison grouped bar chart：Qwen 和 Llama 各 3 bars (Base/TG/LoRA)，Dongre GAR 为 y 轴。两模型呈相同定性 pattern（TG ≈ LoRA >> Base）但 Llama 绝对值分布更紧凑。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 3-way eval 是 C5 (\"partial cross-model evidence\") 的核心数据。关键发现：\n      (1) Gap 存在但更弱（12x vs 22x）—— \"order-of-magnitude\" 措辞仍成立，但不能说 \"同等幅度\"。\n      (2) Gating 无增量贡献在两个架构上一致——这比 gap ratio 的精确数值更有说服力。\n      (3) 一个意外的巧合：两个模型的 TG inference Dongre GAR 都是 0.022——\n      但这源于不同的训练 GAR（0.48 vs 0.26），说明推理时的 floor 值可能由 base model 特性而非训练效果决定。\n      论文策略：Table 6 并排展示两模型结果，Discussion 用一段专门分析 gap ratio 差异\n      （GQA 的 KV 共享如何限制训练 ceiling 但对推理 floor 影响不大），\n      将架构差异转化为分析贡献而非弱化因素。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B gradient conflict analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B 上 3 个 epoch checkpoint 的 NTP-GAR 梯度冲突分析，验证跨模型一致性\"\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_cos_sim_mean: -0.041\n      epoch0_cos_sim_std: 0.048\n      epoch0_mag_ratio: 5.2\n      epoch1_cos_sim_mean: -0.009\n      epoch1_cos_sim_std: 0.052\n      epoch1_mag_ratio: 8.7\n      epoch2_cos_sim_mean: 0.015\n      epoch2_cos_sim_std: 0.044\n      epoch2_mag_ratio: 12.3\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch0: 20/32\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch1: 14/32\n      layers_negative_cos_sim_epoch2: 10/32\n      cross_model_per_layer_cos_sim_correlation_r: 0.43\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama 梯度冲突信号比 Qwen 更弱且更嘈杂——这是 median 档的核心特征。\n      Epoch 0 cos_sim = -0.041（vs Qwen -0.072），绝对值几乎减半。\n      原因：GQA 中 gate 参数的梯度由 32 个 query head 通过 8 个 shared KV head 间接传播，\n      不同 query head group 对 NTP 和 GAR 的梯度方向不一致，aggregate 后相互稀释。\n      Per-layer std = 0.048（vs Qwen 0.031），方差更大，20/32 层为负（63%，vs Qwen 79%）。\n      关键问题：epoch 0 的 confidence interval [-0.041 ± 0.048] 包含零，\n      单凭 Llama 数据无法在统计上拒绝 \"无梯度冲突\" 的零假设。\n      Mag_ratio 起始更低（5.2 vs 7.8）是因为 Llama 训练 GAR 收敛更慢，epoch 0 结束时 GAR loss 仍有更大残余梯度。\n      跨模型 per-layer cos_sim 相关性仅 r=0.43，说明冲突 pattern 与具体架构有关，非完全 architecture-agnostic。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gradient conflict cross-model comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B (28 layers)\", \"Llama-3.1-8B (32 layers)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Ep0 cos_sim (mean ± std)\", \"−0.072 ± 0.031\", \"−0.041 ± 0.048\"]\n          - [\"Ep0 mag_ratio\", \"7.8×\", \"5.2×\"]\n          - [\"Ep2 cos_sim (mean ± std)\", \"+0.011 ± 0.019\", \"+0.015 ± 0.044\"]\n          - [\"Layers neg @ Ep0\", \"22/28 (79%)\", \"20/32 (63%)\"]\n          - [\"Per-layer r (Qwen↔Llama)\", \"—\", \"0.43\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side layer heatmap（Qwen 28 layers vs Llama 32 layers）of cos_sim at epoch 0。Qwen 色调较统一（多数蓝色）；Llama 蓝黄交替更杂乱，直观展示 signal degradation。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 梯度冲突是 paper 中最弱的证据。Confidence interval 包含零，\n      仅凭 Llama 数据无法做出 \"significant gradient conflict\" 的 claim。\n      论文处理：(1) Llama 梯度数据放 Appendix，不进主文 table/figure；\n      (2) 主文仅一句话引用：\"Directionally consistent but noisier gradient conflict observed on Llama-3\n      (Appendix D), with the weaker signal likely attributable to GQA's shared KV projection\n      averaging out per-head gradient directions\"；\n      (3) 强调 Qwen 上的 cleaner signal 是 SP2 的主要支撑，Llama 仅为 \"partial corroboration\"。\n      Per-layer correlation r=0.43 应在 Discussion 中诚实 acknowledge：梯度冲突的 exact layer-level pattern\n      与架构有关，cross-model claim 限于 \"direction of effect\" 层面。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream task sanity check (instruction retention)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"多轮对话中 system prompt 指令遵循准确率测试，建立 GAR 与实际任务表现的关联\"\n    expected_results:\n      task_type: \"system prompt instruction following accuracy\"\n      num_instructions: 5\n      num_conversations: 20\n      num_turns_per_conv: 10\n      base_turn1_accuracy: 0.82\n      base_turn5_accuracy: 0.71\n      base_turn10_accuracy: 0.61\n      base_accuracy_drop: 0.256\n      tg_turn1_accuracy: 0.84\n      tg_turn5_accuracy: 0.73\n      tg_turn10_accuracy: 0.63\n      tg_accuracy_drop: 0.250\n      lora_turn1_accuracy: 0.83\n      lora_turn5_accuracy: 0.72\n      lora_turn10_accuracy: 0.62\n      lora_accuracy_drop: 0.253\n      gar_accuracy_pearson_r: 0.52\n      gar_accuracy_pearson_p: 0.003\n      tg_vs_base_accuracy_p_value: 0.24\n      tg_vs_base_accuracy_significant: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      System prompt instruction following 是 GAR 最直接的下游映射：\n      GAR 衰减意味着模型对 goal tokens 的 attention 降低，应导致 system prompt 指令被 \"遗忘\"。\n      Median 档下 GAR-accuracy correlation r=0.52 (p=0.003)——统计显著但中等强度。\n      r 不更高的原因：instruction following 不仅依赖 attention to goal tokens，\n      还受 in-context learning（中间 turn 可能重述指令）、指令复杂度、conversation topic drift 等因素影响。\n      GAR 是 necessary but not sufficient condition for instruction following。\n      所有模型 accuracy 衰减幅度相似（25-26%），TG 与 Base 无显著差异（p=0.24），\n      与 GAR 层面 \"gating 无增量贡献\" 完全一致。\n      这回应了 W3（\"GAR 作为唯一代理指标\"）：虽然 r=0.52 不是 perfect correlation，\n      但足以证明 GAR 衰减有 real-world consequence，且 gating 的失败同样反映在 task level。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction following accuracy across turns\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Drop\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.82\", \"0.71\", \"0.61\", \"25.6%\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", \"0.84\", \"0.73\", \"0.63\", \"25.0%\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.83\", \"0.72\", \"0.62\", \"25.3%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: GAR-accuracy correlation\"\n        columns: [\"Statistic\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pearson r\", \"0.52\"]\n          - [\"p-value\", \"0.003\"]\n          - [\"N (turn × model)\", \"60\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: per-turn GAR (x) vs instruction following accuracy (y)，所有模型 pooled。正相关趋势可见但散布较大，regression line 标注 r=0.52, p=0.003。色标区分 3 个模型，三者 cluster 重叠。\"\n    analysis: >\n      r=0.52 足以在 paper 中作为 paragraph 级别证据（不值得独立 section），\n      适合放在 Analysis 末尾或 Discussion 中。建议表述：\n      \"GAR degradation correlates with measurable decline in instruction following\n      (r=0.52, p<0.01), providing task-level grounding for our attention-based analysis.\n      However, the moderate correlation suggests additional factors beyond goal attention\n      contribute to instruction retention.\"\n      作为 P2 实验，回应 W3 足矣，不改变 paper 核心叙事。\n      TG 与 Base 在 task level 无显著差异是对 \"gating 无增量贡献\" 最有说服力的呈现方式——\n      reviewer 可能更容易理解 \"accuracy 没变\" 比 \"GAR 没变\"。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0cc558c7-b4b5-4fb8-9519-bf931d8331b3","total_cost_usd":0.8381622499999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17219,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":28493,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17219,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":28493,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17219,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17219},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":12183,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.012287999999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":28493,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":17219,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8258742499999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"cd7cdc6e-6ec2-4576-acb0-2fe6959113f5"}
